[00:18.82]1. Where would my life be, Jehovah,
[00:24.72]Without you by my side?
[00:30.16]Where else would I go, Jehovah?
[00:35.34]Beneath your wings, I hide.
[00:40.90]Life brings fears, pain, and tears;
[00:46.78]You know I am dust.
[00:52.52]But I know in your love I can trust.
[01:03.01]You are my rock—you’re ever true—
[01:08.73]And I will always trust in you.
[01:13.79]You are my shield, my shelter too;
[01:19.49]With all my heart, I trust in you.
[01:25.43]You have always helped me through.
[01:31.61]Yes, in ev'rything I do, I trust in you.
[01:46.39]2. When I talk to you, Jehovah,
[01:51.57]Your strength and peace, I find.
[01:57.55]When you talk to me, Jehovah,
[02:02.39]You soothe my heart and mind.
[02:08.61]Trials fall on us all
[02:14.09]In these final days.
[02:20.71]But I know in your arms I am safe.
[02:30.47]You are my rock—you’re ever true—
[02:36.27]And I will always trust in you.
[02:41.33]You are my shield, my shelter too;
[02:46.95]With all my heart, I trust in you.
[02:52.81]You have always helped me through.
[02:59.13]Yes, in ev'rything I do, I trust in you.
[03:18.57]You are my rock—you’re ever true—
[03:24.23]And I will always trust in you.
[03:29.35]You are my shield, my shelter too;
[03:34.99]With all my heart, I trust in you.
[03:40.85]You have always helped me through.
[03:46.75]Yes, in ev'rything I do, I trust in you—
[03:57.43]I trust in you.
